{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maou's Crucible</strong> is a community-driven horde survivor roguelite featuring original characters  from various creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned by <strong>Germain</strong>, a timeless scholar and alchemist, participants from countless worlds gather within a singularity, a nexus that connects all universes, where they would compete for the title of &quot;Demon Lord&quot;. However, this title is merely a bait to confront a far greater threat lurking beyond reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the Crucible, survive against hordes of enemies, and claim the title of <strong>Demon Lord</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of playable characters</strong> from multiple creators, each with unique abilities and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ upgrades</strong> to create powerful and unpredictable builds each run</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mael","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4087610/a225093aa4db825709ce559658271a8b429105d0.jpg"},{"name":"Efra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4087610/dc75d9121261942f8445079dcc3b784e26475104.jpg"},{"name":"Kristina","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4087610/28eb9e13ac1c08e98a3c51efb9a5d831a925f5d1.jpg"},{"name":"Fiona","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4087610/7d924464eaeeee2dcf59618552795b8309bad6cb.jpg"},{"name":"Rei","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4087610/5f878131595e122a1a30a90d8875f50cb5be85de.jpg"},{"name":"Meteorology","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4087610/a51f0fa7aaeabdfd82533dbdbce33bf3f9016f15.jpg"},{"name":"Marika","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati